//RS /// D-UNIONTYPE1=A: the one member-to-union widening. Every site that turns a
//RS /// member value into its anonymous union (binding, argument, explicit return,
//RS /// tail value, and the implicit or `?(note)` failure hop) builds the union
//RS /// here. The value is typed by the union itself, so it and its constructor
//RS /// name the same canonical carrier row on every tier.
//RS fn lower_union_widening(
//RS     ctx: &mut LowerCtx,
